### HTTP client test file for the loan application API
### Use this file with the JetBrains HTTP Client or VS Code REST Client extension

### 1. Get all loan applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/loans
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get a single loan application by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/loans/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a new loan application
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicant_name": "John Doe",
  "loan_amount": 15000,
  "interest_rate": 5.75
}

### 4. Update an existing loan application
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/loans/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### 5. Delete a loan application
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/loans/1
